{"name":"Butter Icing","hex":"#f5e5da","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"butter icing","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Buttercream."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/butter_icing"}],"entries":[{"title":"Buttercream","blocks":[{"text":"Buttercream, also referred to as butter icing or butter frosting, is a type of icing used for either filling, coating or decorating cakes. The main ingredients are butter and some type of sugar."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Chocolate_Cupcakes_with_Raspberry_Buttercream.jpg/330px-Chocolate_Cupcakes_with_Raspberry_Buttercream.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buttercream"},{"title":"Icing (food)","blocks":[{"text":"Icing is a sweet glaze, made of sugar with a liquid, such as water or milk, that is often enriched with ingredients like butter, eggwhites, cream cheese, or flavorings. It is used to coat or decorate baked goods, such as cakes, donuts, or honey buns. When it is used between layers of cake, it is known as a filling in some foods."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Lemon_bundt_cake_%282%29%2C_January_2010.jpg/330px-Lemon_bundt_cake_%282%29%2C_January_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Icing_(food)"},{"title":"Butter","blocks":[{"text":"Butter is a dairy product made from the fat and protein components of churned cream. It is a semi-solid emulsion at room temperature, consisting of approximately 81% butterfat. It is used at room temperature as a spread, melted as a condiment, and used as a fat in baking, sauce-making, pan frying, and other cooking procedures."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/%C5%A0v%C3%A9dsk%C3%BD_kol%C3%A1%C4%8D_naruby_904_%28cropped%29.JPG/330px-%C5%A0v%C3%A9dsk%C3%BD_kol%C3%A1%C4%8D_naruby_904_%28